"use strict";(globalThis.webpackChunkfastplaz_docs||=[]).push([[5418],{930(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"archive":{"blogPosts":[{"id":"/2026/11/07/release-hero-2026","metadata":{"permalink":"/en/blog/2026/11/07/release-hero-2026","source":"@site/i18n/en/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2026-11-07-release-hero-2026.md","title":"Release: Hero 2026","description":"FastPlaz Hero 2026","date":"2026-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Hero 2026","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","permalink":"/en/blog/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22"}},"content":"![FastPlaz Hero 2026](/img/blog/2026-hero.png)\\n\\nThe 2026 FastPlaz release, code name **\\"Hero\\"**, brings two major features: the same application can run as a **standalone HTTP server** or as **CGI**, and **AI Agent Plane**, a coding agent right inside the Lazarus IDE.\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nThis release is also the result of a thorough review of every unit in `FastPlaz/src` and `tools/src`: about 170 commits, 365 files, +51,000 / \u221211,900 lines, with unit tests for every library.\\n\\n## Headline\\n\\n1. **One binary, two modes: Standalone HTTP and CGI.** A FastPlaz application can run as its own web server or still as CGI under Apache/nginx, with no code changes. [Read more](/docs/standalone)\\n2. **AI Agent Plane.** Claude Code, OpenCode, Pi, GitHub Copilot CLI, and other ACP agents right inside the Lazarus IDE, complete with an MCP server that can open files, edit, _compile_, and create FastPlaz controllers/models. [Read more](/docs/ai-agent-plane)\\n3. **Thorough review and fixes.** Memory leaks, double frees, security holes, and long-standing bugs have been fixed.\\n4. **More secure by default.** Per-form CSRF, HttpOnly/SameSite/Secure session cookies, CSPRNG, XXE protection, _quoted_ SQL, header injection closed.\\n5. **Cross-platform, actually tested.** More than 700 FPCUnit unit tests, run on Windows and Linux.\\n\\n## New Features\\n\\n### Standalone HTTP mode\\n\\n- The new `fastplaz_app` unit replaces `fpcgi`. The mode is selected automatically: `--mode=cgi|http`, the `GATEWAY_INTERFACE` variable, or `systems/server/mode` in `config.json`.\\n- Default `http://127.0.0.1:17845`.\\n- Graceful shutdown (Ctrl+C / SIGTERM), `max_requests`, per-request database connections.\\n- `X-Forwarded-*` support behind a trusted reverse proxy.\\n- The project wizards (Simple, API, Full Package) have an HTTP/CGI Run Mode option.\\n\\n### AI Agent Plane\\n\\n- A _dockable_ chat window under the **FastPlaz \u2192 Agent Plane** menu: markdown answers, code blocks with syntax highlighting, permission cards, and question cards.\\n- Switch runtime, model, and effort right from the chat.\\n- Files changed by the agent are automatically reloaded in the editor.\\n- Built-in MCP server (`127.0.0.1:17826`) with [19 tools](/docs/ai-agent-plane-mcp): editor, search, _compile_ and build, controller/model generators, and FastPlaz reference for the agent.\\n\\n### Library\\n\\n- **Built-in SMTP client** (`smtp_lib`): `TMailer` can send email without Synapse.\\n- **Database**: `ExecScript` / `ExecSQLScript`, `QuoteIdentifier`, `QuoteValue`, and a `SoftDelete` that actually works.\\n- **Theme**: `escape` filter, rewritten `[if]` (comparison operators, nesting), nested `[foreach]`.\\n- **Session**: `RegenerateID`, HttpOnly/SameSite/Secure cookies.\\n- **Redis**: IPv6, full RESP parsing, connect timeout.\\n\\n### IDE Tools\\n\\n- Fast Code supports OpenAI-compatible servers.\\n- Database Explorer: MySQL 8.0 by default, icon toolbar, automatic column width.\\n- **FastPlaz \u2192 Open Console/Terminal** menu and keyboard shortcuts for the FastPlaz menu.\\n- Indonesian translation for the IDE tools.\\n\\n## Before Upgrading\\n\\nSome fixes may change the behavior of existing applications, for example `Redirect`/`die` no longer exit the method, session timeout is in minutes, and `Save`/`Delete` return `False`. Read [Upgrading to the 2026 Release](/docs/upgrade) first.\\n\\nRepository: [github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz) \xb7 Full brief: [RELEASE-2026-Hero.md](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz/blob/development/docs/RELEASE-2026-Hero.md)"},{"id":"/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22","metadata":{"permalink":"/en/blog/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22","source":"@site/i18n/en/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2020-12-22-release-supermom-v0.12.22.md","title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","description":"New Features","date":"2020-12-22T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Hero 2026","permalink":"/en/blog/2026/11/07/release-hero-2026"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","permalink":"/en/blog/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10"}},"content":"### New Features\\n\\n- Database Explorer\\n- Reveal File in Explorer/Finder\\n- JSON Visualization (TreeView)\\n- Regex Tester\\n- Full Package Example\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nRepository available at [https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz)"},{"id":"/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10","metadata":{"permalink":"/en/blog/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10","source":"@site/i18n/en/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2020-11-10-release-hero-v0.11.10.md","title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","description":"FastPlaz Hero","date":"2020-11-10T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Super Mom v0.12.22","permalink":"/en/blog/2020/12/22/release-supermom-v0.12.22"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","permalink":"/en/blog/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0"}},"content":"![FastPlaz Hero](/img/blog/20201110-hero.jpg)\\n\\nAfter waiting more than 5 years, FastPlaz has finally been released to master, with the code name:\\n\\n# **Hero v0.11.0**\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nRepository available at [https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz)"},{"id":"/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/en/blog/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0","source":"@site/i18n/en/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2015-08-17-release-merdeka-v0.0.0.md","title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","description":"Features","date":"2015-08-17T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Hero v0.11.10","permalink":"/en/blog/2020/11/10/release-hero-v0.11.10"},"nextItem":{"title":"Release: Ibu v0.0.0","permalink":"/en/blog/2014/12/22/release-ibu-v0.0.0"}},"content":"### Features\\n\\n- Redis support\\n- Themes generator\\n- Tagstrings\\n- Add html block tag\\n- Add permalink support @theme\\n- Prepare fastplaz integration package\\n\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\nRepository available at [https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz)"},{"id":"/2014/12/22/release-ibu-v0.0.0","metadata":{"permalink":"/en/blog/2014/12/22/release-ibu-v0.0.0","source":"@site/i18n/en/docusaurus-plugin-content-blog/2014-12-22-release-ibu-v0.0.0.md","title":"Release: Ibu v0.0.0","description":"Release Ibu v0.0.0","date":"2014-12-22T00:00:00.000Z","tags":[],"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Luri Darmawan","url":"https://github.com/luridarmawan","imageURL":"https://github.com/luridarmawan.png","key":"luri","page":null}],"frontMatter":{"title":"Release: Ibu v0.0.0","authors":"luri"},"unlisted":false,"prevItem":{"title":"Release: Merdeka v0.0.0","permalink":"/en/blog/2015/08/17/release-merdeka-v0.0.0"}},"content":"[Release Ibu v0.0.0](https://github.com/fastplaz/fastplaz/releases)"}]}}')}}]);